{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600130/extras/titlesteam.png?t=1742482856\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Face countless perils in this fast paced runner where timing and reflexes are everything. Dodge obstacles or slash them with your sword. Perform aerial acrobatics to overcome more challenging sections.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600130/extras/corastralgif1.gif?t=1742482856\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Control Polaris, a powerful and agile warrior that must reach the Core of his world as soon as possible, where he will face a terrible menace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Avoid getting hit, collect objects and complete quests to advance.\u00a0Reach your goal and discover the truth!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Featured in this demo</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">5 fast paced ad difficult levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Smooth controls</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">About 15 minutes of playtime</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Original music for each level</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3600130?t=1742482856","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3600130?t=1742482856","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600130/bf2eab13a8f9cda958d5c298faa0c50ed45419a6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742482856","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600130/bf2eab13a8f9cda958d5c298faa0c50ed45419a6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1742482856","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller